1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,892
One in the morning.

2
00:00:01,942 --> 00:00:08,180
I'm scrolling through the Black Friday
deals… and I land on this:

3
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:11,567
the PS5 controller, 29 percent off.

4
00:00:11,617 --> 00:00:14,241
Honestly, it looks like a bargain.

5
00:00:14,291 --> 00:00:16,973
I almost hit « buy ».

6
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,928
Then I scrolled down a bit.

7
00:00:19,978 --> 00:00:23,598
Right under the price, two tiny lines.

8
00:00:23,648 --> 00:00:29,065
29 percent off… the « recommended price ».

9
00:00:29,115 --> 00:00:34,560
And 14 percent off… the lowest price
of the last thirty days.

10
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:38,168
That's the real drop. Fourteen.

11
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:41,832
That got me curious, so I looked it up.

12
00:00:41,882 --> 00:00:48,062
Last year, Europe checked 314 sites
during Black Friday.

13
00:00:48,112 --> 00:00:53,260
The result: about one deal in
three broke the rules.

14
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:56,245
So I tried something really simple.

15
00:00:56,295 --> 00:01:02,416
I copied the controller's link, pasted it
into an AI that searches the web…

16
00:01:02,466 --> 00:01:05,927
and just asked: « is this a real deal? »

17
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:09,350
Thirty seconds later, the answer.

18
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:17,122
On Black Friday 2024, most of these
controllers were already 54.99 euros.

19
00:01:17,172 --> 00:01:20,615
Another site lists it at that
price right now.

20
00:01:20,665 --> 00:01:23,292
And its advice… wait.

21
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:29,266
One honest detail: the AI admits it
couldn't open the Amazon page.

22
00:01:29,316 --> 00:01:33,342
So you don't take its word for it.

23
00:01:33,392 --> 00:01:35,444
You click its sources.

24
00:01:35,690 --> 00:01:37,902
Anyway. I'm waiting.

25
00:01:37,952 --> 00:01:40,727
And you, what's sitting in your cart?

26
00:01:40,777 --> 00:01:42,515
Tell me in the comments.

